	"data": "Reference: Ollama Model Playbook\n\nLocal models available on [[infra/star]]. Use these when cloud models aren't appropriate (privacy, offline, cost).\n\nRuntime Notes\nStart: systemctl --user start ollama\nKeep OLLAMA_MAX_LOADED_MODELS=1 to avoid VRAM thrash\nFor GPU-bound models: close Steam/games first\nCPU fallback: OLLAMA_GPU_LAYERS=0\n\nModels\n\n| Model | Use Case | Notes |\n|---|---|---|\n| llama3.1:8b-instruct-q4_0 | Primary local — analysis, planning, drafting | Needs GPU (8GB VRAM) |\n|…",
